      A heat pump is one of the biggest single decisions in a modern home — it replaces your furnace, your air conditioner, and a big chunk of your bills, all with one electric box. This is the long-form explainer. If you just want a planning-range cost, the <a href="/heat-pump-cost-calculator/" class="text-brand-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline">heat pump cost calculator</a> is two scrolls away.
